{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:0", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 0, "condition": "normal", "started_at": "2026-10-03T15:17:55.086565+00:00", "payload_sha256": "36dae60a0eb567f88eef1530b2d8be0ae8e04c8b22704b572400917c24278d87", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 3850, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T15:17:58.937279+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2296, "completion_tokens": 342, "total_tokens": 2638, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "这里是一个简洁完整的示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    if task_id == 2:\n        raise ValueError(f\"任务 {task_id} 发生错误\")\n    return f\"任务 {task_id} 的结果\"\n\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(1), fetch_data(2), fetch_data(3)]\n\n    # return_exceptions=True 会把异常对象直接放到返回列表中，不中断其他任务\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历并区分正常结果与异常\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[异常] 任务 {i} 失败: {type(res).__name__} - {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[成功] 任务 {i} 成功: {res}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出：**\n```text\n[成功] 任务 1 成功: 任务 1 的结果\n[异常] 任务 2 失败: ValueError - 任务 2 发生错误\n[成功] 任务 3 成功: 任务 3 的结果\n```\n\n通过 `isinstance(res, Exception)` 就可以把正常结果与抛出的异常对象区分开来逐一处理了。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:1", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 1, "condition": "short", "started_at": "2026-10-03T15:17:58.937782+00:00", "payload_sha256": "00a6564adf2408a232a14e542140e7ac3a145b448cb22ce737f0ac421f1c5f1c", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 2904, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T15:18:01.842191+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash-control", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2296, "completion_tokens": 292, "total_tokens": 2588, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "这是一个简洁完整的示例，展示了如何并发运行任务并区分正常返回值与异常对象：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    if task_id == 2:\n        raise ValueError(f\"任务 {task_id} 发生错误\")\n    return f\"任务 {task_id} 的结果\"\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(i) for i in range(1, 4)]\n    \n    # 设置 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作结果存入列表\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[{i}] 失败: {type(res).__name__} - {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[{i}] 成功: {res}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**输出结果：**\n```text\n[1] 成功: 任务 1 的结果\n[2] 失败: ValueError - 任务 2 发生错误\n[3] 成功: 任务 3 的结果\n```", "finish_reason": "stop"}
