{"id": "default_voice:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:0", "anchor_id": "default_voice:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 0, "condition": "normal", "started_at": "2026-10-03T15:19:54.043461+00:00", "payload_sha256": "290d9b38bd381e488ad76f7bc6e03c928e436ec64e5cc81a37dc0e7f2ca1a77e", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 5379, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T15:19:59.422710+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2140, "completion_tokens": 1120, "total_tokens": 3260, "reasoning_tokens": 822}, "reply": "这是一个简洁完整的示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def task_success(name):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    return f\"任务 {name} 执行成功\"\n\nasync def task_fail(name):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    raise ValueError(f\"任务 {name} 发生了错误\")\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [\n        task_success(\"A\"),\n        task_fail(\"B\"),\n        task_success(\"C\"),\n    ]\n\n    # 设置 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作普通元素收集\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历并区分正常结果与异常对象\n    for i, res in enumerate(results):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[{i}] 任务失败，异常为: {res!r}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[{i}] 任务成功，结果为: {res}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n运行这段代码时，任务 B 抛出的 `ValueError` 不会中断程序，而是作为异常实例保存在列表的对应索引处。遍历时通过 `isinstance(res, Exception)` 就能清晰区分哪些执行成功、哪些触发了错误。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
